  "description": "Woo-Bin is an expert at seducing rich ladies with his handsome looks, and lives off of the gifts he receives from them. He approaches the rich, beautiful Su-Ji to prey on her... but ends up falling in love! Blinded by love, Woo-Bin doesn't realize that Su-Ji isn't the angel he thought she was, but rather has a dark side that slowly entangles him. Each with clearly different intentions, Woo-Bin and Su-Ji fall into a romance that can't be recycled!\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
